{"id":314,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"個性尊重で自主自立を育てる明星学園","feature_description":"明星学園は、『個性尊重・自主自立・自由平等』の教育理念を軸に、小学校から高等学校まで一貫した校風を築いています。日々の学校生活や行事、学習の中で、自分で考え行動する姿勢と他者を尊重する態度を育てる方針が一貫しています。理念と実践の結びつきが把握しやすい学校です。公式サイトの学校案内や教育ページが整理され、学びの方針と学校生活の両面を確認しやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":5654,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.myojogakuen.ed.jp/high_school/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5655,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.myojogakuen.ed.jp/high_school/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5656,"name":"男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.myojogakuen.ed.jp/high_school/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5657,"name":"体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.myojogakuen.ed.jp/high_school/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5658,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.myojogakuen.ed.jp/high_school/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5659,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.myojogakuen.ed.jp/high_school/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5660,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.myojogakuen.ed.jp/high_school/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5661,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.myojogakuen.ed.jp/high_school/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5662,"name":"女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.myojogakuen.ed.jp/high_school/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5663,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.myojogakuen.ed.jp/high_school/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5664,"name":"女子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.myojogakuen.ed.jp/high_school/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5665,"name":"アンサンブル部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://ww